  <section class="prose" aria-label="Teaching overview">
    <p class="lede">I teach trombone, euphonium, and low brass at two Twin Cities universities, from first-year music majors through graduate students. If you are considering either program, come play for me before you audition &mdash; a sample lesson costs you nothing and tells us both far more than an audition day can.</p>
  </section>

