    <article class="studio">
      <h3>University of Minnesota</h3>
      <p class="studio__role">Visiting Lecturer of Trombone and Euphonium</p>
      <p>I lead the trombone and euphonium studio in the School of Music as primary teacher of record, teaching applied lessons to undergraduate and graduate students across performance, music education, music therapy, BA, and minor tracks. Alongside weekly lessons, the studio runs studio class, trombone choir, chamber coaching, and audition preparation for orchestras, graduate programs, and military bands.</p>
